/-!
# S9-C3h154: linear-Plebanski-aware primitive Cauchy update

C3h153 generated the synchronized local actual `U₃`, but the historical
C3h121/C3h123 path would still call the old `F = ⋆ᵢ B` Lorentz producer.
This module lifts the corrected action law to every spatial contact:

```text
proof-free source + primitive Cauchy state
→ at every contact, linear-Plebanski local actual
→ canonical Cauchy restriction of that actual
→ complete ten-coordinate primitive velocity
→ whole-slice instantaneous Cauchy update.
```

Only the Lorentz component is replaced.  Its temporal response is the unique
one generated by `F = ⋆ᵢ B - λ`; the coframe, auxiliary, multiplier, P286,
scalar, matter, and dual components remain the existing joint-action
outputs.  No residual, endpoint, inverse principal, range witness, supplied
target, coefficient, or branch receipt is accepted by a constructor.

This is the C3h123-style frozen-input pointwise local-action update for the
new action law.  It is not yet an autonomous restart-compatible integral
flow, a global holonomic development, or complete simultaneous stationarity.
-/

